The i.MX 93 CM33 drives the B half of MU1 and MU2 (Linux owns the A half), but
MIMX9352_cm33_COMMON.h declares only the MUA windows. Add MU1_MUB/MU2_MUB at their
reference-manual bases so the HAL emits their singletons and the MU doorbell can
bind them. Introduced by 4efb041 ("imx93 should assign mua to linux and mub to cm33").
